    {
      "name": "4. Circuit breaker (MANUAL - see this folder's description)",
      "description": "University Record calls Session Service over gRPC and guards each Session instance with a circuit breaker (3 failures in 5 s x 3.5 = 17.5 s, then the instance is removed from Service Discovery and from its pool).\n\nSTEPS\n1. In a terminal: docker pause pad-team-17-server-moderation-session-service-1   (the replica freezes but stays registered)\n2. Run the first request here 8 times (Collection Runner, iterations = 8, or send it by hand). Calls that hit the frozen replica time out after 3 s: 503 UPSTREAM_UNAVAILABLE; the others are 201.\n3. Watch: docker compose logs -f university-record-service  -> 'Circuit breaker ... threshold reached' and 'Session Service instance REMOVED'.\n4. Run the second request: now every call is 201 (the frozen replica is out of the pool).\n5. docker unpause pad-team-17-server-moderation-session-service-1  -> after the 30 s quarantine and its next heartbeat the instance is added back ('Session Service instance added').\n\nThe container name may differ: docker compose ps.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create Record while one Session replica is frozen (201 or 503 until the breaker trips)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('201 (healthy replica) or 503 (frozen replica)', () => pm.expect([201,503]).to.include(pm.response.code));",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 503) pm.test('503 is UPSTREAM_UNAVAILABLE', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().error.code).to.eql('UPSTREAM_UNAVAILABLE'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"session_id\": \"{{session_id}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/records",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "records"
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Record after the breaker removed the frozen replica (always 201)",
